      "beat_id": "B02",
      "act": "I — The Set",
      "estimated_duration_s": 19,
      "narration_text": "Patterns fourteen through twenty, and they have a different flavour from the first thirteen. Those added capability. These subtract it deliberately — capping messages, routing to cheaper models, pruning branches, blocking inputs, ranking work. Constraints, not features. That is what turns a prototype into production.",
