    {
      "beat_id": "B08",
      "act": "VII — Triage",
      "estimated_duration_s": 21,
      "narration_text": "Score every task on value, time sensitivity, effort and risk, then rank the queue and take the top one. The complication is that finishing a task changes the environment, so the ranking has to recompute constantly. Done badly, agents thrash between unrelated work — and non-deterministic execution order makes the whole thing genuinely hard to debug.",
